    title: "Gremlins",
    developer: Some("Scott Smith"),
    description: Some("A two-screen movie tie-in. First you scramble Billy Peltzer side to side to catch the falling mogwai before they reach the food and turn into gremlins — and keep them clear of the puddles, since water makes anything that touches it multiply. Then it flips to a shooting gallery where you gun down the descending gremlin waves, with a few flash cubes held back to clear the screen when the swarm doubles and triples."),
